1
00:00:02,878 --> 00:00:08,259
<c.simplifiedchinese>他是我们最出类拔萃的剑客</c.simplifiedchinese>

2
00:00:08,347 --> 00:00:10,266
<c.simplifiedchinese>报酬昂贵</c.simplifiedchinese>

3
00:00:10,351 --> 00:00:11,769
<c.simplifiedchinese>你付得起吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

4
00:00:17,490 --> 00:00:19,826
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是天花病毒</c.simplifiedchinese>

5
00:00:21,583 --> 00:00:22,792
<c.simplifiedchinese>天花</c.simplifiedchinese>

6
00:00:23,837 --> 00:00:26,673
<c.simplifiedchinese>又称豆疮</c.simplifiedchinese>

7
00:00:26,760 --> 00:00:31,639
<c.simplifiedchinese>是一种由天花病毒感染引起的传染病</c.simplifiedchinese>

8
00:00:31,728 --> 00:00:34,856
<c.simplifiedchinese>因为对人有极高的传染性</c.simplifiedchinese>

9
00:00:34,942 --> 00:00:39,238
<c.simplifiedchinese>被视为致命的疾病 让人十分恐惧</c.simplifiedchinese>

10
00:00:39,827 --> 00:00:41,829
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果我把这个病毒传播开</c.simplifiedchinese>

11
00:00:41,915 --> 00:00:46,252
<c.simplifiedchinese>制造出患者 多少钱我都能赚到手</c.simplifiedchinese>

12
00:00:46,340 --> 00:00:50,344
<c.simplifiedchinese>报酬多贵都没问题</c.simplifiedchinese>

13
00:00:51,475 --> 00:00:52,935
<c.simplifiedchinese>那好吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

14
00:00:53,020 --> 00:00:55,815
<c.simplifiedchinese>还有一件事</c.simplifiedchinese>

15
00:00:55,901 --> 00:01:01,532
<c.simplifiedchinese>因为职业的缘故
我很清楚品质不好的药没什么用</c.simplifiedchinese>

16
00:01:02,122 --> 00:01:04,582
<c.simplifiedchinese>保镖也是一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

17
00:01:06,588 --> 00:01:08,632
<c.simplifiedchinese>我会付你一大笔钱</c.simplifiedchinese>

18
00:01:08,718 --> 00:01:11,471
<c.simplifiedchinese>让我们见识一下他的实力吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

19
00:01:12,685 --> 00:01:16,063
<c.simplifiedchinese>你只会看到你的保镖输得很惨</c.simplifiedchinese>

20
00:01:22,203 --> 00:01:25,290
<c.simplifiedchinese>这把剑的形状很有趣啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

21
00:01:26,503 --> 00:01:28,130
<c.simplifiedchinese>看招！</c.simplifiedchinese>

22
00:01:28,925 --> 00:01:34,931
<c.simplifiedchinese>你以为你那根小细棍
能打败本大爷的金属棒吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

23
00:01:35,021 --> 00:01:37,815
<c.simplifiedchinese>看我给你点苦头尝尝！</c.simplifiedchinese>

24
00:01:43,412 --> 00:01:46,790
<c.simplifiedchinese>究竟发生了什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

25
00:01:47,796 --> 00:01:51,383
<c.simplifiedchinese>东方的刀和西洋的剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

26
00:01:51,470 --> 00:01:57,392
<c.simplifiedchinese>究竟哪个更强呢？
分个胜负吧 刽子手拔刀斋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

27
00:02:00,696 --> 00:02:04,367
<c.simplifiedchinese>（原作：和月伸宏
集英社《周刊少年JUMP》）</c.simplifiedchinese>

28
00:03:33,465 --> 00:03:39,721
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过真没想到
你是女孩子装扮成男性啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

29
00:03:40,438 --> 00:03:43,482
<c.simplifiedchinese>不仅仅是医生</c.simplifiedchinese>

30
00:03:43,569 --> 00:03:45,737
<c.simplifiedchinese>女性无论技能是否精湛</c.simplifiedchinese>

31
00:03:45,823 --> 00:03:50,786
<c.simplifiedchinese>从事男性为主的职业总是很难被信任</c.simplifiedchinese>

32
00:03:50,875 --> 00:03:57,006
<c.simplifiedchinese>实际上护士和女仆
比起女医生更受人们信赖</c.simplifiedchinese>

33
00:03:57,096 --> 00:03:59,515
<c.simplifiedchinese>在西方也是一样啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

34
00:03:59,601 --> 00:04:00,977
<c.simplifiedchinese>是</c.simplifiedchinese>

35
00:04:01,062 --> 00:04:04,691
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以我穿上增高鞋 戴上高筒帽</c.simplifiedchinese>

36
00:04:05,279 --> 00:04:09,366
<c.simplifiedchinese>改变声线和行为方式
甚至戴上了面具</c.simplifiedchinese>

37
00:04:09,454 --> 00:04:12,790
<c.simplifiedchinese>你能改变外表已经很让在下吃惊了</c.simplifiedchinese>

38
00:04:12,877 --> 00:04:15,213
<c.simplifiedchinese>没想到甚至还能改变声线</c.simplifiedchinese>

39
00:04:15,925 --> 00:04:18,469
<c.simplifiedchinese>你一定练习了很久吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

40
00:04:18,555 --> 00:04:21,141
<c.simplifiedchinese>我很久之前就很擅长这些</c.simplifiedchinese>

41
00:04:21,228 --> 00:04:24,314
<c.simplifiedchinese>以前在家经常一个人演独角戏</c.simplifiedchinese>

42
00:04:24,901 --> 00:04:26,486
<c.simplifiedchinese>“哦 罗密欧”</c.simplifiedchinese>

43
00:04:26,571 --> 00:04:28,198
<c.simplifiedchinese>“朱丽叶”</c.simplifiedchinese>

44
00:04:28,283 --> 00:04:30,327
<c.simplifiedchinese>“你为什么是罗密欧？”</c.simplifiedchinese>

45
00:04:35,047 --> 00:04:36,382
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过…</c.simplifiedchinese>

46
00:04:37,718 --> 00:04:38,678
<c.simplifiedchinese>戴着面具？</c.simplifiedchinese>

47
00:04:38,762 --> 00:04:40,305
<c.simplifiedchinese>来历不明</c.simplifiedchinese>

48
00:04:40,391 --> 00:04:41,767
<c.simplifiedchinese>他真的是医生吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

49
00:04:41,851 --> 00:04:44,437
<c.simplifiedchinese>最好不要牵扯进去</c.simplifiedchinese>

50
00:04:44,524 --> 00:04:47,402
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是很难办啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

51
00:04:47,488 --> 00:04:49,657
<c.simplifiedchinese>你把自己伪装成男性</c.simplifiedchinese>

52
00:04:49,742 --> 00:04:51,911
<c.simplifiedchinese>却被人当成可疑的家伙了</c.simplifiedchinese>

53
00:04:52,498 --> 00:04:53,833
<c.simplifiedchinese>没关系的</c.simplifiedchinese>

54
00:04:53,917 --> 00:04:55,961
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是我自己选择的生活</c.simplifiedchinese>

55
00:04:58,343 --> 00:05:00,387
<c.simplifiedchinese>要是在这假面后</c.simplifiedchinese>

56
00:05:00,472 --> 00:05:03,892
<c.simplifiedchinese>有个人人都可以
健康生活的世界就好了</c.simplifiedchinese>

57
00:05:05,023 --> 00:05:07,150
<c.simplifiedchinese>听起来太不切实际了 是吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

58
00:05:08,155 --> 00:05:08,989
<c.simplifiedchinese>不</c.simplifiedchinese>

59
00:05:10,242 --> 00:05:12,536
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下不是故意要打听这些的</c.simplifiedchinese>

60
00:05:12,622 --> 00:05:14,915
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下这就要走了</c.simplifiedchinese>

61
00:05:16,045 --> 00:05:19,632
<c.simplifiedchinese>既然你是个女孩子
在下就不能住在这里了</c.simplifiedchinese>

62
00:05:21,389 --> 00:05:23,558
<c.simplifiedchinese>-埃尔德医生
-什么事？</c.simplifiedchinese>

63
00:05:23,644 --> 00:05:27,898
<c.simplifiedchinese>男吉他很信任你</c.simplifiedchinese>

64
00:05:27,985 --> 00:05:32,490
<c.simplifiedchinese>那对母女也一定很感谢你做的一切</c.simplifiedchinese>

65
00:05:33,914 --> 00:05:38,794
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的选择或许没错</c.simplifiedchinese>

66
00:05:39,384 --> 00:05:40,301
<c.simplifiedchinese>告辞</c.simplifiedchinese>

67
00:05:49,904 --> 00:05:52,281
<c.simplifiedchinese>飞天御剑流</c.simplifiedchinese>

68
00:05:52,368 --> 00:05:54,036
<c.simplifiedchinese>我听说过</c.simplifiedchinese>

69
00:05:56,167 --> 00:05:59,045
<c.simplifiedchinese>但没想到它真的存在</c.simplifiedchinese>

70
00:05:59,966 --> 00:06:03,636
<c.simplifiedchinese>你用飞天御剑流杀过人吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

71
00:06:03,723 --> 00:06:05,016
<c.simplifiedchinese>没有</c.simplifiedchinese>

72
00:06:05,602 --> 00:06:08,772
<c.simplifiedchinese>那你觉得能杀得了人吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

73
00:06:12,616 --> 00:06:17,997
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果在我这沾满鲜血的刀
和那些牺牲的人命后</c.simplifiedchinese>

74
00:06:18,085 --> 00:06:22,006
<c.simplifiedchinese>有个人人能安心生活的新时代的话…</c.simplifiedchinese>

75
00:06:23,388 --> 00:06:25,599
<c.simplifiedchinese>要是在这假面后</c.simplifiedchinese>

76
00:06:25,684 --> 00:06:29,396
<c.simplifiedchinese>有个人人都可以
健康生活的世界就好了</c.simplifiedchinese>

77
00:06:37,708 --> 00:06:38,751
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦啰？</c.simplifiedchinese>

78
00:06:42,217 --> 00:06:43,259
<c.simplifiedchinese>医生！</c.simplifiedchinese>

79
00:06:43,345 --> 00:06:44,596
<c.simplifiedchinese>埃尔德医生！</c.simplifiedchinese>

80
00:06:45,599 --> 00:06:48,185
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么事 男吉？</c.simplifiedchinese>

81
00:06:48,271 --> 00:06:49,439
<c.simplifiedchinese>哎？</c.simplifiedchinese>

82
00:06:49,524 --> 00:06:52,276
<c.simplifiedchinese>你没有收到消息吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

83
00:06:52,863 --> 00:06:53,822
<c.simplifiedchinese>哎呀 算了</c.simplifiedchinese>

84
00:06:53,907 --> 00:06:55,200
<c.simplifiedchinese>跟我来吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

85
00:06:56,329 --> 00:06:57,580
<c.simplifiedchinese>急诊吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

86
00:06:57,665 --> 00:07:01,835
<c.simplifiedchinese>不 他们指定了看病时间
应该不是急诊</c.simplifiedchinese>

87
00:07:01,923 --> 00:07:03,758
<c.simplifiedchinese>指定了看病时间？</c.simplifiedchinese>

88
00:07:03,843 --> 00:07:06,054
<c.simplifiedchinese>在日出前最黑暗的时候吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

89
00:07:08,645 --> 00:07:09,980
<c.simplifiedchinese>好奇怪啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

90
00:07:10,064 --> 00:07:11,065
<c.simplifiedchinese>是很奇怪</c.simplifiedchinese>

91
00:07:11,860 --> 00:07:13,736
<c.simplifiedchinese>马路中间有个人！</c.simplifiedchinese>

92
00:07:13,822 --> 00:07:15,490
<c.simplifiedchinese>很危险 快躲开！</c.simplifiedchinese>

93
00:07:22,255 --> 00:07:23,339
<c.simplifiedchinese>那是什么东西？</c.simplifiedchinese>

94
00:07:23,425 --> 00:07:24,968
<c.simplifiedchinese>他要干什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

95
00:07:25,052 --> 00:07:26,470
<c.simplifiedchinese>让一让！</c.simplifiedchinese>

96
00:07:26,556 --> 00:07:29,934
<c.simplifiedchinese>螺旋剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

97
00:07:30,021 --> 00:07:32,857
<c.simplifiedchinese>地狱风暴！</c.simplifiedchinese>

98
00:07:41,419 --> 00:07:43,046
<c.simplifiedchinese>你已经知道他很厉害了</c.simplifiedchinese>

99
00:07:43,130 --> 00:07:45,007
<c.simplifiedchinese>为什么还特意过来看着？</c.simplifiedchinese>

100
00:07:45,092 --> 00:07:48,012
<c.simplifiedchinese>我来亲眼看看他值不值这个价钱</c.simplifiedchinese>

101
00:07:48,098 --> 00:07:50,976
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不相信这个世界上的任何人</c.simplifiedchinese>

102
00:07:51,063 --> 00:07:53,231
<c.simplifiedchinese>当然也不相信你</c.simplifiedchinese>

103
00:07:54,152 --> 00:07:56,529
<c.simplifiedchinese>将身体扭转至极限</c.simplifiedchinese>

104
00:07:56,616 --> 00:08:01,245
<c.simplifiedchinese>利用回旋力来发挥最大的力量</c.simplifiedchinese>

105
00:08:01,876 --> 00:08:05,672
<c.simplifiedchinese>这就是螺旋剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

106
00:08:06,970 --> 00:08:07,845
<c.simplifiedchinese>医生！</c.simplifiedchinese>

107
00:08:07,930 --> 00:08:09,807
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个武士在哪里？</c.simplifiedchinese>

108
00:08:09,892 --> 00:08:10,768
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

109
00:08:10,852 --> 00:08:13,063
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个有十字刀疤的武士</c.simplifiedchinese>

110
00:08:13,148 --> 00:08:14,400
<c.simplifiedchinese>放开你的手</c.simplifiedchinese>

111
00:08:18,075 --> 00:08:21,537
<c.simplifiedchinese>刚才一直没机会给埃尔德医生传口信</c.simplifiedchinese>

112
00:08:21,624 --> 00:08:28,131
<c.simplifiedchinese>让旅馆翻译成日语费了些功夫
里面的内容是约埃尔德医生出来</c.simplifiedchinese>

113
00:08:28,220 --> 00:08:30,597
<c.simplifiedchinese>浪客先生…</c.simplifiedchinese>

114
00:08:31,351 --> 00:08:33,270
<c.simplifiedchinese>的确有十字刀疤</c.simplifiedchinese>

115
00:08:33,355 --> 00:08:35,065
<c.simplifiedchinese>的确是武士</c.simplifiedchinese>

116
00:08:36,571 --> 00:08:39,907
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们都是在剑术上登峰造极的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

117
00:08:39,994 --> 00:08:41,662
<c.simplifiedchinese>来决斗吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

118
00:08:42,248 --> 00:08:46,377
<c.simplifiedchinese>我想知道究竟谁的剑术更强</c.simplifiedchinese>

119
00:08:46,466 --> 00:08:49,594
<c.simplifiedchinese>传说中的最强男人</c.simplifiedchinese>

120
00:08:49,680 --> 00:08:51,599
<c.simplifiedchinese>刽子手拔刀斋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

121
00:08:54,230 --> 00:08:57,650
<c.simplifiedchinese>作为暗杀者 你暗杀过很多重要人物</c.simplifiedchinese>

122
00:08:57,738 --> 00:09:02,826
<c.simplifiedchinese>作为一名游击剑客
你在幕末曾与许多猛士交手</c.simplifiedchinese>

123
00:09:02,915 --> 00:09:06,210
<c.simplifiedchinese>毫无疑问你是最强的武士</c.simplifiedchinese>

124
00:09:06,296 --> 00:09:07,506
<c.simplifiedchinese>刽子手拔刀斋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

125
00:09:08,802 --> 00:09:11,429
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个名号十年前就已经被舍弃了</c.simplifiedchinese>

126
00:09:11,516 --> 00:09:12,934
<c.simplifiedchinese>荒谬！</c.simplifiedchinese>

127
00:09:13,018 --> 00:09:14,103
<c.simplifiedchinese>你舍弃了那个名号？</c.simplifiedchinese>

128
00:09:14,187 --> 00:09:16,606
<c.simplifiedchinese>那你腰间的刀是什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

129
00:09:17,193 --> 00:09:18,361
<c.simplifiedchinese>来 拔刀吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

130
00:09:18,445 --> 00:09:20,572
<c.simplifiedchinese>拔出刀来与我战斗！</c.simplifiedchinese>

131
00:09:35,939 --> 00:09:39,359
<c.simplifiedchinese>既然你如此期望 那就没办法了</c.simplifiedchinese>

132
00:09:43,955 --> 00:09:46,583
<c.simplifiedchinese>请原谅我的粗鲁</c.simplifiedchinese>

133
00:09:51,846 --> 00:09:54,348
<c.simplifiedchinese>我听说刀是武士的灵魂</c.simplifiedchinese>

134
00:09:59,904 --> 00:10:02,531
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在释放你的灵魂吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

135
00:10:02,618 --> 00:10:05,954
<c.simplifiedchinese>在刀剑时代彻底灭亡之前！</c.simplifiedchinese>

136
00:10:06,041 --> 00:10:09,794
<c.simplifiedchinese>地狱风暴！</c.simplifiedchinese>

137
00:10:10,800 --> 00:10:11,635
<c.simplifiedchinese>那一招！</c.simplifiedchinese>

138
00:10:13,640 --> 00:10:15,016
<c.simplifiedchinese>不能被打中！</c.simplifiedchinese>

139
00:10:15,100 --> 00:10:16,769
<c.simplifiedchinese>否则你会被卷起来吹走的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

140
00:10:24,494 --> 00:10:27,372
<c.simplifiedchinese>地狱暴风雨！</c.simplifiedchinese>

141
00:10:43,156 --> 00:10:47,369
<c.simplifiedchinese>为了增加强度经过改造的剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

142
00:10:47,456 --> 00:10:51,419
<c.simplifiedchinese>再加上甚至进行了身体改造的
艾斯佩拉尔的剑术</c.simplifiedchinese>

143
00:10:51,506 --> 00:10:54,592
<c.simplifiedchinese>竟然被这个男人完美躲开了</c.simplifiedchinese>

144
00:10:54,680 --> 00:10:57,599
<c.simplifiedchinese>不愧是传说中的刽子手</c.simplifiedchinese>

145
00:11:02,486 --> 00:11:09,452
<c.simplifiedchinese>他要使出很久没用的
螺旋剑的终极奥义了</c.simplifiedchinese>

146
00:11:10,669 --> 00:11:12,254
<c.simplifiedchinese>那是什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

147
00:11:12,340 --> 00:11:14,759
<c.simplifiedchinese>他的身体正在疯狂地扭曲！</c.simplifiedchinese>

148
00:11:15,387 --> 00:11:19,266
<c.simplifiedchinese>你我是最后的武士与最后的剑客</c.simplifiedchinese>

149
00:11:19,938 --> 00:11:22,733
<c.simplifiedchinese>究竟谁会笑到最后</c.simplifiedchinese>

150
00:11:22,819 --> 00:11:25,238
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在决战开始了</c.simplifiedchinese>

151
00:11:32,379 --> 00:11:36,342
<c.simplifiedchinese>你我是最后的武士与最后的剑客</c.simplifiedchinese>

152
00:11:37,014 --> 00:11:40,142
<c.simplifiedchinese>究竟谁会笑到最后</c.simplifiedchinese>

153
00:11:40,229 --> 00:11:42,064
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在决战开始了</c.simplifiedchinese>

154
00:11:42,149 --> 00:11:43,275
<c.simplifiedchinese>看招</c.simplifiedchinese>

155
00:11:43,360 --> 00:11:46,113
<c.simplifiedchinese>我最强最快的奥义！</c.simplifiedchinese>

156
00:11:46,199 --> 00:11:49,285
<c.simplifiedchinese>地狱龙卷风！</c.simplifiedchinese>

157
00:11:54,257 --> 00:11:55,133
<c.simplifiedchinese>浪客先生！</c.simplifiedchinese>

158
00:12:07,575 --> 00:12:08,450
<c.simplifiedchinese>太好了</c.simplifiedchinese>

159
00:12:11,959 --> 00:12:13,294
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

160
00:12:13,378 --> 00:12:19,342
<c.simplifiedchinese>竟然把艾斯佩拉尔奥义的威力
施加到了自身的斩击上来回击他</c.simplifiedchinese>

161
00:12:27,823 --> 00:12:30,701
<c.simplifiedchinese>笑到最后的是武士</c.simplifiedchinese>

162
00:12:31,789 --> 00:12:33,166
<c.simplifiedchinese>算了</c.simplifiedchinese>

163
00:12:33,251 --> 00:12:38,173
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果被你这样的人杀死
是我的命运 那也不错</c.simplifiedchinese>

164
00:12:38,762 --> 00:12:41,598
<c.simplifiedchinese>来 杀了我吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

165
00:12:41,684 --> 00:12:43,311
<c.simplifiedchinese>别说这种话</c.simplifiedchinese>

166
00:12:43,396 --> 00:12:44,940
<c.simplifiedchinese>你好好看看</c.simplifiedchinese>

167
00:12:45,734 --> 00:12:48,111
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是在下现在的佩刀</c.simplifiedchinese>

168
00:12:48,698 --> 00:12:50,450
<c.simplifiedchinese>逆刃刀…</c.simplifiedchinese>

169
00:12:51,412 --> 00:12:56,793
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下使用的飞天御剑流
的确是能取人性命的杀人剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

170
00:12:56,881 --> 00:13:01,177
<c.simplifiedchinese>想要不取人性命 就只能用逆刃刀</c.simplifiedchinese>

171
00:13:04,982 --> 00:13:08,402
<c.simplifiedchinese>刀是武士的灵魂</c.simplifiedchinese>

172
00:13:08,488 --> 00:13:09,906
<c.simplifiedchinese>我懂了</c.simplifiedchinese>

173
00:13:09,992 --> 00:13:13,078
<c.simplifiedchinese>这就是你现在灵魂的样子</c.simplifiedchinese>

174
00:13:14,333 --> 00:13:16,294
<c.simplifiedchinese>根本不在一个级别！</c.simplifiedchinese>

175
00:13:17,631 --> 00:13:19,258
<c.simplifiedchinese>该死 那就尝尝这个吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

176
00:13:25,314 --> 00:13:26,690
<c.simplifiedchinese>天花病毒…</c.simplifiedchinese>

177
00:13:27,735 --> 00:13:29,987
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是天花病毒！非常危险！</c.simplifiedchinese>

178
00:13:39,008 --> 00:13:40,134
<c.simplifiedchinese>天花病毒！</c.simplifiedchinese>

179
00:13:40,218 --> 00:13:42,929
<c.simplifiedchinese>借着风在横滨传播吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

180
00:13:43,016 --> 00:13:44,559
<c.simplifiedchinese>趁着一片混乱…</c.simplifiedchinese>

181
00:13:44,643 --> 00:13:45,770
<c.simplifiedchinese>我会逃跑！</c.simplifiedchinese>

182
00:13:59,673 --> 00:14:01,384
<c.simplifiedchinese>胜负已分</c.simplifiedchinese>

183
00:14:01,469 --> 00:14:03,554
<c.simplifiedchinese>不要在我的败绩上抹黑</c.simplifiedchinese>

184
00:14:06,270 --> 00:14:07,647
<c.simplifiedchinese>石津！你个混蛋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

185
00:14:12,991 --> 00:14:15,994
<c.simplifiedchinese>能看到这么精彩的对决我很满足</c.simplifiedchinese>

186
00:14:16,082 --> 00:14:17,375
<c.simplifiedchinese>我投降</c.simplifiedchinese>

187
00:14:27,604 --> 00:14:31,066
<c.simplifiedchinese>（国际酒店）</c.simplifiedchinese>

188
00:14:39,253 --> 00:14:41,839
<c.simplifiedchinese>你救了我？</c.simplifiedchinese>

189
00:14:41,924 --> 00:14:45,553
<c.simplifiedchinese>伤者病者都是我的患者</c.simplifiedchinese>

190
00:14:45,640 --> 00:14:47,100
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

191
00:14:47,186 --> 00:14:48,228
<c.simplifiedchinese>没错</c.simplifiedchinese>

192
00:14:49,148 --> 00:14:51,317
<c.simplifiedchinese>刀剑的时代即将落幕时</c.simplifiedchinese>

193
00:14:51,402 --> 00:14:55,615
<c.simplifiedchinese>我想成为剑术最强的人 不过…</c.simplifiedchinese>

194
00:14:55,702 --> 00:14:59,956
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个梦想被东方的武士打败了</c.simplifiedchinese>

195
00:15:00,796 --> 00:15:05,008
<c.simplifiedchinese>就算我的伤治好了
活着也没有什么意义了</c.simplifiedchinese>

196
00:15:07,267 --> 00:15:12,022
<c.simplifiedchinese>明知刀剑的时代即将落幕
还想成为剑术最强的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

197
00:15:12,694 --> 00:15:14,905
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是很值得骄傲的事</c.simplifiedchinese>

198
00:15:15,784 --> 00:15:21,331
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过目标太大就很容易迷失方向</c.simplifiedchinese>

199
00:15:23,633 --> 00:15:25,802
<c.simplifiedchinese>你没见过想在横滨旅游</c.simplifiedchinese>

200
00:15:25,887 --> 00:15:28,473
<c.simplifiedchinese>却拿着日本地图的游客吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

201
00:15:29,186 --> 00:15:32,439
<c.simplifiedchinese>我迷失了方向？</c.simplifiedchinese>

202
00:15:36,200 --> 00:15:39,662
<c.simplifiedchinese>或许吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

203
00:15:42,169 --> 00:15:43,754
<c.simplifiedchinese>石津被逮捕</c.simplifiedchinese>

204
00:15:43,840 --> 00:15:47,051
<c.simplifiedchinese>中介人被驱逐出境</c.simplifiedchinese>

205
00:15:47,138 --> 00:15:49,432
<c.simplifiedchinese>那就可以放心了</c.simplifiedchinese>

206
00:15:49,518 --> 00:15:54,565
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下看来似乎没那么容易放心啊…</c.simplifiedchinese>

207
00:15:54,653 --> 00:15:57,114
<c.simplifiedchinese>我很荣幸能跟你交手</c.simplifiedchinese>

208
00:15:57,199 --> 00:15:58,284
<c.simplifiedchinese>拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

209
00:15:58,870 --> 00:16:02,498
<c.simplifiedchinese>不对 你说你已经舍弃那个名号了</c.simplifiedchinese>

210
00:16:03,086 --> 00:16:04,922
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下是浪客</c.simplifiedchinese>

211
00:16:05,007 --> 00:16:06,592
<c.simplifiedchinese>四处流浪的剑客</c.simplifiedchinese>

212
00:16:07,178 --> 00:16:09,055
<c.simplifiedchinese>我是艾斯佩拉尔</c.simplifiedchinese>

213
00:16:09,140 --> 00:16:12,769
<c.simplifiedchinese>对刀剑时代的落幕感到绝望的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

214
00:16:12,856 --> 00:16:16,318
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过埃尔德医生让我明白了</c.simplifiedchinese>

215
00:16:16,405 --> 00:16:19,408
<c.simplifiedchinese>用太大的地图反而会迷失方向</c.simplifiedchinese>

216
00:16:20,288 --> 00:16:24,042
<c.simplifiedchinese>与其对时代变迁等大事感到绝望</c.simplifiedchinese>

217
00:16:24,128 --> 00:16:28,591
<c.simplifiedchinese>对更小的事抱有希望
并专注其中也不错</c.simplifiedchinese>

218
00:16:28,680 --> 00:16:30,515
<c.simplifiedchinese>更小的事情？</c.simplifiedchinese>

219
00:16:31,226 --> 00:16:36,982
<c.simplifiedchinese>只要我还是剑士
对我来说刀剑的时代就还没结束</c.simplifiedchinese>

220
00:16:37,698 --> 00:16:39,700
<c.simplifiedchinese>我这样想</c.simplifiedchinese>

221
00:16:39,785 --> 00:16:41,078
<c.simplifiedchinese>因此…</c.simplifiedchinese>

222
00:16:43,125 --> 00:16:44,793
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的剑…</c.simplifiedchinese>

223
00:16:44,878 --> 00:16:48,757
<c.simplifiedchinese>就像你把刀换成了逆刃刀一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

224
00:16:48,845 --> 00:16:52,390
<c.simplifiedchinese>我把我的螺旋剑换成了直刃</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:16:52,477 --> 00:16:56,023
<c.simplifiedchinese>并决定作为一名剑士
来保护埃尔德医生</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:16:56,109 --> 00:16:59,112
<c.simplifiedchinese>我一个人也没关系的</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:16:59,198 --> 00:17:04,120
<c.simplifiedchinese>至少在到达下一个目的地美国之前
让我一起同行吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:17:04,208 --> 00:17:05,668
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是没办法</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:17:05,754 --> 00:17:07,005
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:17:07,089 --> 00:17:10,384
<c.simplifiedchinese>昨天的敌人变成了今天的朋友啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:17:10,472 --> 00:17:11,347
<c.simplifiedchinese>没错</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:17:12,642 --> 00:17:16,772
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们接下来要离开日本了吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:17:16,859 --> 00:17:18,319
<c.simplifiedchinese>-没错
-没错</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:17:18,404 --> 00:17:19,781
<c.simplifiedchinese>路上保重</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:17:30,970 --> 00:17:33,348
<c.simplifiedchinese>我去办理出国的手续</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:17:33,976 --> 00:17:36,104
<c.simplifiedchinese>我很高兴你来送我</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:17:36,189 --> 00:17:41,444
<c.simplifiedchinese>这让我感觉下次我来的时候
你还会在这里迎接我</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:17:41,534 --> 00:17:43,661
<c.simplifiedchinese>不只是在下来为你送行啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:17:43,746 --> 00:17:44,664
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:17:45,207 --> 00:17:46,542
<c.simplifiedchinese>医生！</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:17:46,627 --> 00:17:47,711
<c.simplifiedchinese>埃尔德医生！</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:17:47,796 --> 00:17:49,923
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们听男吉说了</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:17:50,008 --> 00:17:53,595
<c.simplifiedchinese>你从人渣泥庵手中拯救了居留地</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:17:53,683 --> 00:17:55,059
<c.simplifiedchinese>下次再来啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:17:55,144 --> 00:17:57,521
<c.simplifiedchinese>妈妈身体好多了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:17:57,607 --> 00:17:58,900
<c.simplifiedchinese>谢谢你！</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:17:58,985 --> 00:18:00,611
<c.simplifiedchinese>太感谢了</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:18:00,697 --> 00:18:03,575
<c.simplifiedchinese>下次会有很多人欢迎你回来啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:18:04,203 --> 00:18:06,038
<c.simplifiedchinese>谢谢大家！</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:18:06,124 --> 00:18:08,501
<c.simplifiedchinese>大家一定要健康啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:18:09,548 --> 00:18:11,216
<c.simplifiedchinese>她好漂亮！</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:18:12,679 --> 00:18:13,930
<c.simplifiedchinese>路上保重</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:18:14,015 --> 00:18:19,353
<c.simplifiedchinese>今后也请继续帮助伤者和病人</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:18:19,442 --> 00:18:20,484
<c.simplifiedchinese>我会的</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:18:20,570 --> 00:18:24,616
<c.simplifiedchinese>我会努力让大家都能健康生活的</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:18:29,963 --> 00:18:31,924
<c.simplifiedchinese>好大的伤疤</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:18:32,009 --> 00:18:34,553
<c.simplifiedchinese>看起来是旧剑伤</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:18:34,640 --> 00:18:37,392
<c.simplifiedchinese>但又像是昨天才形成的</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:18:38,230 --> 00:18:44,110
<c.simplifiedchinese>身体和心灵的联系
比你想象的更紧密深入</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:18:44,701 --> 00:18:50,958
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然不清楚你过去发生了什么
但如果那和你的伤疤有关的话…</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:18:51,590 --> 00:18:56,720
<c.simplifiedchinese>干脆换个新的地方开始新的生活吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:18:57,309 --> 00:18:58,852
<c.simplifiedchinese>这被称为转地疗养</c.simplifiedchinese>

263
00:18:58,938 --> 00:19:03,109
<c.simplifiedchinese>离开熟悉的环境进入新的环境</c.simplifiedchinese>

264
00:19:03,196 --> 00:19:05,615
<c.simplifiedchinese>能使人放松并得到治愈</c.simplifiedchinese>

265
00:19:07,121 --> 00:19:09,290
<c.simplifiedchinese>谢谢你的关心</c.simplifiedchinese>

266
00:19:09,375 --> 00:19:10,584
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过</c.simplifiedchinese>

267
00:19:10,670 --> 00:19:13,423
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下过去的路是自己选择的</c.simplifiedchinese>

268
00:19:14,135 --> 00:19:16,512
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下不能放手</c.simplifiedchinese>

269
00:19:17,182 --> 00:19:20,811
<c.simplifiedchinese>过去的经历和这伤疤
在下都将继续带着</c.simplifiedchinese>

270
00:19:21,859 --> 00:19:23,736
<c.simplifiedchinese>至少</c.simplifiedchinese>

271
00:19:24,781 --> 00:19:29,202
<c.simplifiedchinese>要用这把刀尽可能保护更多的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

272
00:19:31,127 --> 00:19:32,670
<c.simplifiedchinese>也是呀</c.simplifiedchinese>

273
00:19:32,756 --> 00:19:35,258
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果刀是武士的灵魂</c.simplifiedchinese>

274
00:19:35,344 --> 00:19:37,929
<c.simplifiedchinese>那么对于拿着不杀之剑的你来说</c.simplifiedchinese>

275
00:19:38,016 --> 00:19:41,478
<c.simplifiedchinese>这种生活很相称啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

276
00:21:14,291 --> 00:21:16,544
<c.simplifiedchinese>故事讲完了</c.simplifiedchinese>

277
00:21:16,629 --> 00:21:20,424
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂 剑心 这是多久以前的事了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

278
00:21:20,512 --> 00:21:22,013
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯…</c.simplifiedchinese>

279
00:21:22,099 --> 00:21:26,019
<c.simplifiedchinese>是来到神谷道场前五天左右的事</c.simplifiedchinese>

280
00:21:26,107 --> 00:21:27,233
<c.simplifiedchinese>-五天？
-五天？</c.simplifiedchinese>

281
00:21:27,317 --> 00:21:29,820
<c.simplifiedchinese>那么近发生的事？</c.simplifiedchinese>

282
00:21:29,906 --> 00:21:33,743
<c.simplifiedchinese>我还以为肯定是很久以前的事</c.simplifiedchinese>

283
00:21:33,831 --> 00:21:37,668
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下没说过要讲一个很古老的故事啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

284
00:21:37,754 --> 00:21:39,464
<c.simplifiedchinese>这倒也是</c.simplifiedchinese>

285
00:21:39,550 --> 00:21:42,261
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是我有一件事很在意</c.simplifiedchinese>

286
00:21:42,347 --> 00:21:43,223
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦啰？</c.simplifiedchinese>

287
00:21:43,308 --> 00:21:44,684
<c.simplifiedchinese>失礼了</c.simplifiedchinese>

288
00:21:49,278 --> 00:21:53,449
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿剑你说能闻到花园里瑞香花的味道</c.simplifiedchinese>

289
00:21:53,536 --> 00:21:56,706
<c.simplifiedchinese>却尝不到红茶的味道</c.simplifiedchinese>

290
00:21:56,792 --> 00:21:58,794
<c.simplifiedchinese>是啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

291
00:21:58,881 --> 00:22:03,052
<c.simplifiedchinese>但今天你却说茶很好喝</c.simplifiedchinese>

292
00:22:04,934 --> 00:22:06,645
<c.simplifiedchinese>是啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

293
00:22:06,729 --> 00:22:07,897
<c.simplifiedchinese>那就没事了</c.simplifiedchinese>

294
00:22:11,280 --> 00:22:12,698
<c.simplifiedchinese>最后一件事</c.simplifiedchinese>

295
00:22:12,783 --> 00:22:15,285
<c.simplifiedchinese>我作为医生的建议</c.simplifiedchinese>

296
00:22:16,040 --> 00:22:21,295
<c.simplifiedchinese>任何的伤病都需要治疗和静养</c.simplifiedchinese>

297
00:22:21,384 --> 00:22:26,430
<c.simplifiedchinese>安顿在一个地方
让身心都得到休息非常重要</c.simplifiedchinese>

298
00:22:27,521 --> 00:22:32,359
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果今后遇到了叫你停下来的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

299
00:22:32,447 --> 00:22:36,326
<c.simplifiedchinese>请尝试为他们停下脚步</c.simplifiedchinese>

300
00:22:39,294 --> 00:22:40,295
<c.simplifiedchinese>明白了</c.simplifiedchinese>

301
00:22:41,465 --> 00:22:43,968
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下会记在心里的</c.simplifiedchinese>

302
00:22:47,310 --> 00:22:50,397
<c.simplifiedchinese>下一集 《苏醒之狼》</c.simplifiedchinese>

